OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 4, dies after car and
OL,4,Aoff-road bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year-old boy has died after a
OL,7,Fcar and an off-road bike were involved
OL,8,Fin a crash in Newark.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,11,Fservices were called to Churchill Drive
OL,12,Fat about 18:00 BST on Sunday after
OL,13,Freceiving reports of a collision.
OL,15,FThe boy, who was a passenger on the
OL,16,Foff-road bike, was declared dead at the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
